# Quasar UI (one canon)

Do not open superseded UI rules or `InboundShipmentListPage.vue`. Dense column widths only: grep `docs/guides/ui-standards.md` — never full-read for chrome.

## Tokens (always `--tf-*`, never `--bw-*`)

- Theme: `var(--tf-theme-*)`, Quasar `color="primary"`.
- Surfaces/text: `--tf-neutral-*`. State hues: `--tf-success|warning|error|info` (+ `-soft`).
- Status colors: `<TfStatusBadge :status>` + `statusMap.ts` only — no page hex / `blue-1` / per-page status fns.
- Dark: only via `app.scss` `body.body--dark`. Pages never define dark hex palettes.
- Icons: `ph ph-*`. Fonts: `--tf-font-ui` / `--tf-font-mono`.

## Layout

| Screen | Shell | Title |
|--------|-------|-------|
| Ops list/grid (default) | `q-page.page-fixed-layout` (`calc(100vh - 55px)`, `overflow: hidden`), compact toolbar, sticky table scroll | Breadcrumbs only — no in-page H1 / `AppPageHeader` |
| Hub / overview / investor / treasury | `q-page.tf-page` + `.tf-page__stack` + `AppPageHeader` | Allowed |
| Browse entity rows | `TfEntityListShell` + `TfEntityListRow` | — |

**New ops list:** copy `docs/guides/OpsListPage.skeleton.vue` (<80 lines). Do not open the live shipment list page for chrome.

## Decisions (stop re-litigating)

| Topic | Rule |
|-------|------|
| Inputs | `outlined dense hide-bottom-space`. Search in toolbars may add `rounded`. No `filled` / `standout`. |
| Buttons | Prefer `TfBtn`. Max one filled primary (header **or** empty-state, never both). `:ripple="false"`. Radius `--tf-radius-sm` (8px). No pill except shop CTAs. |
| Shadows | Flat tables/toolbars. No page `box-shadow` / hover lift. Raised only: dialogs, drawers, empty-state CTAs. |
| Row tints / left accent | Allowed on **existing** high-density ops tables that already use them. **New** lists: status via `TfStatusBadge` only — do not invent new row-tint systems. |
| Tabs/filters | `TfDrawerSectionTabs` (or Header). Side panels: `TfSideSheet`. Empty: `TfEmptyState`. Confirm/toast: `TfConfirmDialog` / `useNotify` or `appFeedback.ts`. |
| Spacing | `q-pa-sm\|md`, `q-gutter-sm`. Avoid `q-pa-lg\|xl`. |

## UX (frictionless)

One obvious next step. Disabled primary explains why (`q-tooltip` / banner). No Help essays, tours, or links to `doc/*.md` on the page. Loading: `PageInitialLoader` / `TfSkeletonRows`; background: `GlobalAjaxBar`.

## Size & chrome scope

- Target page ≤180 lines (max 250); split parts, don’t paste mega pages.
- **UI chrome only** (Tf swaps, spacing, shell, tokens; no product invent): up to **8 files / 400 lines** without the core pause.

## Checklist (grep your diff)

`#[0-9a-f]{3,6}`, `--bw-`, `shadow`, `filled`, `push`, `rounded` (non-search), `q-pa-xl`, `blue-|teal-|amber|grey-[0-9]`, `AppPageHeader` on ops lists.
